// gnucap plugin for the interdigitated MoM capacitor.
// Compiles the shared cap_cmom compact model (the same Verilog-A the ngspice
// OSDI build uses) into a gnucap-modelgen plugin. cap_cmom is a full behavioural
// module with no corner/mismatch dependence, so it is compiled directly (no
// paramset binding is needed). The module cap_cmom(PLUS, MINUS, SUB) is exposed;
// tie SUB to ground for the classic 2-terminal use, as the ngspice subckt does.
// Resolved through the Makefile MGFLAGS include path -I ../../verilog-a/cap_cmom.

`include "cap_cmom.va"
